Ga__root Description-module__T5pcGa__clamped"><div class="Description-module__T5pcGa__wrapper"><p data-cy="document-description">Dokumen ini menjelaskan cabang-cabang ilmu biologi dan tingkat organisasi kehidupan yang mencakup molekul, sel, jaringan, dan makhluk hidup, baik uniseluler maupun multiseluler. Selain itu, dijelaskan juga metode ilmiah yang digunakan dalam penelitian, termasuk langkah-langkah untuk mengumpulkan informasi dan pengamatan variabel. Cabang biologi seperti zoologi, botani, dan mikrobiologi juga diperkenalkan.</p><!--&--><div class="CategoryLinks-module__FTe7aG__root"><a class="link link-module__Gim9xG__root link-module__Gim9xG__primary weight-medium link-module__Gim9xG__medium link-module__Gim9xG__underline" aria-label="View the featured presentations, documents and infographics in the Education Category" href="https://www.slideshare.net/category/education">Education</a><span class="text Text-module__DjdFRa__root weight-regular Text-module__DjdFRa__medium">â—¦</span></div><!--/&--></div><!--&--><button type="button" class="button Button-module__4HgN-q__root Button-module__4HgN-q__primary Button-module__4HgN-q__text Button-module__4HgN-q__medium Description-module__T5pcGa__readMore" aria-label="Read more" data-cy="read-more-button"><span><span class="Button-module__4HgN-q__spinnerSlide"><svg class="spinner" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 50 50" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" data-dd-excluded-activity-mutations="true"><path d="M43.935,25.145c0-10.318-8.364-18.683-18.683-18.683c-10.318,0-18.683,8.365-18.683,18.683h4.068c0-8.071,6.543-14.615,14.615-14.615c8.072,0,14.615,6.543,14.615,14.615H43.935z"><animateTransform attributeType="xml" attributeName="transform" type="rotate" from="0 25 25" to="360 25 25" dur="0.6s" repeatCount="indefinite"></animateTransform></path></svg></span><span class="ellipsis"><span class="Description-module__T5pcGa__readMoreLabel">Read more</span></span></span></button><!--/&--></div></div><mai